OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt after woman raped on Trans
OL,4,APennine Trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are appealing for
OL,7,Finformation after a woman was raped on
OL,8,Fa popular walking route.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said the attack
OL,11,Ftook place on the Trans Pennine Trail,
OL,12,Fbetween Mexborough Road and Harlington
OL,13,FRoad, near Bolton-upon-Dearne, at about
OL,14,F14:50 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe force said the area had been
OL,17,Fcordoned off to allow officers to
OL,18,Fgather forensic evidence, and has
OL,19,Fappealed for anyone with information
OL,20,Fabout the incident to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
