OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt after woman raped on Trans
OL,4,APennine Trail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect is described as tall, with
OL,7,Fa stocky build. He was wearing a dark
OL,8,Fjumper, black gloves and a black face
OL,9,Fcovering and spoke with a southern
OL,10,Faccent.
